== Effects ==
* {{dlc|nr+}} Mom's foot periodically comes down.
** {{dlc|nr}} The foot stomps every full minute (based on the in-game timer).
** {{dlc|r}} The foot stomps every 20 seconds (based on the in-game timer).
* The foot deals 300 damage.
* {{dlc|r+}} During combat, dropping this trinket will cause Mom's foot to stomp on its location.
* The foot also hurts Isaac for a full heart.

== Synergies ==
* {{dlc+|rnr+}} {{A|Golden Trinket}}/{{I|Mom's Box|n}}: Each copy lowers the time between stomps.{{dlc-}}
** {{dlc+|r+}} Adds 1 more foot stomp per stack.{{dlc-}}

== Notes ==
* {{dlc|nr}} As the foot counts as an explosion, the damage can be avoided with {{i|Pyromaniac}} or {{i|Host Hat}}.
* Unlike the foot spawned by {{P|II - The High Priestess}} or {{I|Mom's Shovel}}, this foot doesn't target enemies nor Isaac.
* The impact can open doors, including {{r|Secret Room}} entrances.

